[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええと、ホロッとした食感にするには……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's see, to get that crumbly texture..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おい。そこの素材じゃねぇか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey. What about that ingredient over there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルアッカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Scarlet"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ありがとう、ルアッカ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, th-thank you, Scarlet!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クリセルダ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（初めは、クリセルダがパルメ族の存在に\n\u3000気付いたこと）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It started when Criselda became aware of the Palme's existence."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私たちの歴史に自由なんかないことに気付いて、\n\u3000解放を目指して極夜の錬金党を立ち上げて）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When she realized our history was devoid of freedom, she sought liberation and formed the Polar Night Alchemists."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そんなクリセルダの元に、渇望を持つ仲間が\n\u3000集ってきた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Others with their own yearnings gathered around her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私も、クリセルダに救われて仲間になって、\n\u3000それ以来、ずっと一緒にいる）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She saved me... and I joined them. We've been together ever since."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。それから、どんなことがあっても幸せだった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. After that, I was happy no matter what happened."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私たちは、渇望のためなら他の人のことなんか\n\u3000顧みず、世間では悪事と呼ばれることもした）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For our yearnings, we paid no mind to others. We did things the world called evil."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（それでも信念があった）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But we had our convictions."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（その信念のために戦い抜いて、レスナたちに敗れて、\n\u3000そして、今があって）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We fought for those convictions, lost to Resna and her friends, and... now we're here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "幸せ、だなぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm... happy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "故郷では、誰にも認められずに「魔女」だなんて\n呼ばれてたんだもんね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No one recognized you back home. They called you a 'witch.'"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アオナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Azure"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュ君が、極夜の錬金党に入ったことを、\nとんでもない回り道なんて言う人はいるだろうけれど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Some might say joining the Polar Night Alchemists was a terrible detour for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ムラサキ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Violet"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。そんなことはまったくない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. But that's not true at all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クリセルダと出会えなかったら。\n錬金党じゃなかったら……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If I hadn't met Criselda... if I hadn't been part of the alchemists..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は、私の渇望を閉じ込めてしまって、\n今の私じゃなかったから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I would've locked away my yearning. I wouldn't be who I am today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（改めてクリセルダに「ありがとう」って\n\u3000伝えたいの）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to tell Criselda 'thank you' properly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]